    <title>Fischl x Slime - A Special Delivery [Animation]The day is here! We now present to you, Fischl!*:・ﾟ✧٩(｡◕ ꇴ ◕｡)۶✧*・ﾟ:*This was a huge journey with so much more than we ever expected! Thank you all so much for your patience!❤️18 months of animation, 3 months of audio, and 2 months for Hu Tao and friends in the middle! Somehow we stayed under 2 years still! ٩(｡•`◡´•｡)۶ But let&apos;s get back to the quicker releases now, no short films for a bit (｡&gt; ‿ ◕｡)We poured thousands of hours of work into this between us, and finally added a third member near the end too! More hands, more eyes, and lots of fun plans ahead! Please join us in welcoming Shuro to the team!❤️And a huge thank you to Rii () for somehow following our crazy schedule and getting really great recordings to us so fast! We were spoiled for variety and for speed, we really couldn&apos;t have finished so fast without her!❤️Another thank you to Toon () for all of their help with our community as well! You&apos;ve been a big help for a long time!❤️And of course all of you, our wonderful community! We&apos;re grateful for all of your support and thank you once again for your kind messages, and for enjoying our animations!❤️❤️❤️=======================================And up next we&apos;ll be sharing the first looks at our collaboration with ProjektMelody! It will be coming to you much faster, but let&apos;s save a little mystery for a proper announcement in the near future (｡&gt; ‿ ◕｡)=======================================You can also find links to all of our socials here: https://t.co/NBGRxJU4TrThere you will find our Pixiv (you will need a free account), Twitter links, and our Patreon where some amazing people go out of their way to make this all possible! We couldn&apos;t do it without them and their amazing generosity!❤️(っ^ ◡ ^c)❤️Direct Download: https://t.co/2yQWHOyCGOAlternate Link: https://t.co/d1I474g9dJThank you all once again, and please enjoy!With love,ViciNeko, Kitsune, and Shuro (づ￣ ³￣)づ ❤️</title>
